Thus  $t = \tfrac 92$ , so  $BC = \tfrac{49}2$  and the area of  $ABCD$  is  $\tfrac{49}2\cdot 6\sqrt 3 = 147\sqrt 3$ .  The requested sum is  $\boxed{150}$ .</details>

