Let  $O$  and  $H$  be the circumcenter and the orthocenter respectively of triangle  $ABC$ . It is known that  $BH$  is the bisector of angle  $ABO$ . The line passing through  $O$  and parallel to  $AB$  meets  $AC$  at  $K$ . Prove that  $AH = AK$ .
