rams at  $1/2$  are equal but these are  $\frac{d}{dt}(xy\sin(\theta_1))_{t=1/2}=x'(1/2)y(1/2)+x(1/2)y'(1/2)+x(1/2)y(1/2)\theta_1'(1/2)\cos(\theta_1(1/2)) =x'(1/2)y(1/2)+x(1/2)y'(1/2)=\frac{d}{dt}(xy\sin(\theta_2))_{t=1/2}$  done.

