=&\sqrt{\frac{1-\frac{25}{13\cdot 21} }{ 1-\frac{25}{13 \cdot 31} }}
=&\sqrt{\frac{13-\frac{25}{21} }{ 13-\frac{25}{31} }}
=&\sqrt{\frac{\frac{248}{21}}{ \frac{378}{31}}}
=&\sqrt{\frac{248 \cdot 31}{378 \cdot 21}}
=&\sqrt{\frac{8 \cdot 31^2}{18 \cdot 21^2}}
