so  $D$ ,  $O$ , and  $Z$  are collinear. Therefore, since   $$ \angle OAX=90^{\circ}-\angle ABC=\angle AYX, $$   we get  $OA$  is tangent to the circumcircle of  $AXY$ , and since  $\angle OZA=\angle OAZ=\angle AYZ$ ,  $OZ$  is also tangent to the circumcircle of  $AXY$ , so  $DZ$  is tangent to the circumcircle of  $AXY$ .

