Let  $I_A$ ,  $I_B$ ,  $I_C$  be the excenters of triangle  $ABC$ , and let  $V$  be the Bevan point of triangle  $ABC$ .

[asy]
import geometry;

unitsize(1 cm);

pair[] A, B, C, I, O;
pair X;

A[0] = (1,3);
B[0] = (0,0);
C[0] = (4,0);
