There are two other expressions like that (rotational symmetry) and by adding them up:
\begin{align*}[PQR]=&\frac18[ABC]-\frac{\sqrt3}{32}(2AK^2+2BK^2+2CK^2-AB^2-BC^2-CA^2)
=&\frac{\sqrt3}{32}+\frac{3\sqrt3}{32}-\frac{\sqrt3}{32}\cdot 1164t^2=&\frac{15\sqrt2}{194+40\sqrt{6}}
