Name the gardener Alice and the lumberjack Bob. The answer is  $5 \cdot 674^2$ . The strategy for Bob is the following: he colors the board in the way shown below

[asy]
for(int x = 0; x < 9; x+=3) {
for(int y = 0; y < 9; y+=3) {
fill((x+1,y+1)--(x+3,y+1)--(x+3,y+3)--(x+1,y+3)--cycle, grey);
}
}

